WEBVTT

00:00:03.510 --> 00:00:05.270
That was fun.

00:00:05.520 --> 00:00:08.430
Thanks for everything today, Kuromine-kun.

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:09.750
S-Sure.

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:10.780
It was fun.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.120
<i>Going to the amusement park
with Shiragami really was fun.</i>

00:00:16.870 --> 00:00:21.540
<i>She was really freaking out 
on the first roller coaster,</i>

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:24.670
<i>but then she got completely 
hooked on thrill rides.</i>

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:27.900
<i>On the other hand, I thought she'd 
be okay with haunted houses,</i>

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:29.590
<i>but she was so scared.</i>

00:00:30.150 --> 00:00:32.460
<i>And the reason she wanted to 
overcome her sun problem</i>

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:35.830
<i>was apparently so that she could 
go to the amusement park</i>

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:37.640
<i>to see where her parents went on a date.</i>

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.810
<i>I'm so glad I got to hear all 
kinds of things about Shiragami.</i>

00:00:42.770 --> 00:00:43.800
<i>And yet,</i>

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:46.270
<i>I was totally spaced out toward the end.</i>

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:49.480
My childhood friend is a wolf man.

00:00:50.030 --> 00:00:53.060
<i>Shiragami has a male childhood friend.</i>

00:00:54.230 --> 00:00:55.920
<i>Just what is he like?</i>

00:00:57.770 --> 00:00:58.700
Shiragami?

00:00:59.520 --> 00:01:02.950
You weren't at home, 
so I looked for you everywhere.

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:05.200
Long time no see,

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:06.490
Youko.

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:41.010
<b>Beware of the Wolf Man!</b>

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:40.300
Beware of the Wolf Man!

00:02:41.570 --> 00:02:44.480
You should give me a call once in a while.

00:02:44.480 --> 00:02:46.020
Me, Shishido Shirou!

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:48.200
Sh-Shirou?

00:02:48.200 --> 00:02:52.360
<i>S-Some tough-looking guy's talking to her!</i>

00:02:52.360 --> 00:02:55.870
<i>W-Wait, but he called Shiragami 
by her first name just now.</i>

00:02:55.870 --> 00:02:57.440
<i>So they know each other, right?</i>

00:02:58.050 --> 00:02:59.880
You say that,

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:01.950
but whenever I call, Shiho picks up.

00:03:03.110 --> 00:03:06.180
<i>Now that I get a better look, 
his teeth are all jagged!</i>

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:09.120
<i>Is this the wolf man?</i>

00:03:09.680 --> 00:03:13.130
<i>B-But maybe it's too soon 
to assume that just yet.</i>

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:16.920
<i>I never even imagined Shiragami 
might be a vampire,</i>

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:21.550
<i>and I'd have never been able to 
tell the class rep was an alien.</i>

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:23.180
<i>But...</i>

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:26.680
<i>This guy's so obvious even 
before he transforms.</i>

00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:29.870
Anyway, what are you doing here, Shirou?

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:31.680
That's what I should be asking.

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:33.810
The sun's still out. What's going on?

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:35.400
Well, I was...

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:38.350
N-No, I'll tell you about that later.

00:03:38.350 --> 00:03:39.980
Did you need something from me?

00:03:39.980 --> 00:03:41.950
Oh, that's right.

00:03:41.950 --> 00:03:44.470
Your old man asked me for a favor.

00:03:45.220 --> 00:03:46.280
What's your problem, kid?

00:03:47.260 --> 00:03:48.760
What are you staring at?

00:03:48.760 --> 00:03:50.030
I-I'm sorry!

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:51.970
If you got something to say, spill it!

00:03:52.430 --> 00:03:54.120
Ah, n-no, I don't...

00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:03.230
Youko! What was that for?

00:04:03.230 --> 00:04:04.640
And why are you clapping?

00:04:05.140 --> 00:04:05.840
I'm sorry!

00:04:06.440 --> 00:04:08.740
Youko, is he with y—

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:13.560
Y-Youko...

00:04:13.860 --> 00:04:16.400
You didn't go to the amusement 
park together, did you?

00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:17.480
Yeah, so?

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:24.700
<i>Th-This can't be good.</i>

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:29.850
I'm leaving.

00:04:29.850 --> 00:04:32.410
What? Why'd you even come here?

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:34.920
Hey, kid.

00:04:35.180 --> 00:04:37.080
Y-Yes? Yes, sir?

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:40.960
Be happy together with Youko.

00:04:40.960 --> 00:04:43.380
<i>Huh? Did he just cheer me on?</i>

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:44.680
<i>And in tears?</i>

00:04:45.720 --> 00:04:47.420
<i>Hang on.</i>

00:04:47.420 --> 00:04:50.430
<i>Did he suddenly say he's leaving because...</i>

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:53.000
W-Wait a second!

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:56.650
Shiragami and I aren't what you're thinking.

00:04:56.930 --> 00:04:58.150
Kuromine-kun?

00:04:58.320 --> 00:05:01.200
It's like, you know, um...

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:02.640
Oh, friends!

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:04.320
Yeah, we're just friends!

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:07.570
<i>Huh? Wait...</i>

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:10.360
<i>I made myself sad saying that.</i>

00:05:11.290 --> 00:05:14.010
Kuromine-kun and I aren't what...

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:17.500
N-No! We're not!

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:21.550
We were supposed to go to the 
amusement park with some other people.

00:05:21.740 --> 00:05:23.520
We're really just friends!

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:24.880
We're just friends!

00:05:24.880 --> 00:05:25.840
<b>Just friends</b>

00:05:26.170 --> 00:05:27.590
We're really just friends!

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:29.600
We're just friends!

00:05:29.810 --> 00:05:31.640
There's no way it would ever

00:05:31.640 --> 00:05:33.990
be anything like that between us!

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:37.570
W-Wait, why does that mean you have to leave?

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:38.760
I don't get it.

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:40.900
W-Well, because...

00:05:40.900 --> 00:05:43.810
Y'know, it's not cool for a dude to get between

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:45.070
a young couple in love.

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:47.410
Especially when it's my childhood friend.

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:49.050
To protect you is only morally right!

00:05:48.450 --> 00:05:49.990
<b>Man</b>

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:52.050
<i>Childhood friend?</i>

00:05:53.070 --> 00:05:54.830
<i>So he really is</i>

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:57.530
<i>Shiragami's childhood friend,</i>

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:00.170
<i>the wolf man!</i>

00:06:01.240 --> 00:06:03.500
<i>And judging from that exchange,</i>

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:05.930
<i>it sounds like he also...</i>

00:06:07.190 --> 00:06:09.970
A man speaks with his back.

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:12.760
Nah, I have no idea what your back's saying.

00:06:13.070 --> 00:06:16.560
<i>Wait, Shiragami seems not to have a clue.</i>

00:06:16.560 --> 00:06:18.290
<i>I feel more of an affinity</i>

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:20.520
<i>than rivalry towards him.</i>

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:23.600
Enough of that!

00:06:23.600 --> 00:06:26.380
Youko, let me get one thing straight.

00:06:26.380 --> 00:06:27.150
What?

00:06:28.790 --> 00:06:29.880
That kid...

00:06:29.880 --> 00:06:32.120
Is he an ordinary human?

00:06:32.550 --> 00:06:34.620
Huh? Yeah.

00:06:36.340 --> 00:06:37.200
I see.

00:06:38.640 --> 00:06:41.740
So, Kuromine, was it?

00:06:41.740 --> 00:06:43.180
Y-Yes.

00:06:43.180 --> 00:06:44.870
Sorry about earlier.

00:06:44.870 --> 00:06:46.420
Grabbing you and all that.

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:50.260
No, no. I'm sorry I stared at you.

00:06:57.620 --> 00:06:58.590
Kuromine.

00:06:59.020 --> 00:07:01.420
There's something I need to ask you.

00:07:02.450 --> 00:07:03.900
What is it?

00:07:04.780 --> 00:07:07.820
Why aren't you surprised by my fangs?

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:12.460
Youko, I was trying to tell you earlier...

00:07:12.460 --> 00:07:15.830
I'm here because your old man 
asked me for a favor.

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:18.590
If anyone finds out about your secret,

00:07:18.590 --> 00:07:21.390
you'll quit school and 
go back to your old man.

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:24.270
He wanted me to find out

00:07:24.270 --> 00:07:26.010
if you've been keeping that promise.

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:30.670
Kuromine isn't surprised 
because he knows your secret.

00:07:30.940 --> 00:07:35.140
Because he knows our kind exist. Am I wrong?

00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:37.350
Well, Youko?

00:07:37.650 --> 00:07:39.440
T-Time out!

00:07:40.330 --> 00:07:42.500
What the hell are you talking about, punk?

00:07:42.500 --> 00:07:43.980
Let go!

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:45.690
<i>Crap, crap, crap!</i>

00:07:45.690 --> 00:07:47.080
<i>What am I doing?</i>

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:49.940
<i>B-But this is no time to be freaking out.</i>

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:52.320
<i>I have to do something, or Shiragami...</i>

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:56.600
I-I don't know anything!

00:07:56.600 --> 00:07:57.740
I have no idea!

00:07:57.740 --> 00:07:59.190
Shiragami's secret?

00:07:59.190 --> 00:08:02.330
I have no clue what you're talking about!

00:08:02.630 --> 00:08:05.360
Wh-What the hell are you going on about?

00:08:05.360 --> 00:08:07.790
I-I'll beat the crap out of you, bastard!

00:08:08.570 --> 00:08:10.050
Kuromine-kun...

00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:12.760
You're always so...

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:15.080
Your fangs didn't surprise me?

00:08:15.080 --> 00:08:16.640
O-Of course they did!

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:18.790
S-Seriously, they did! Seriously!

00:08:18.790 --> 00:08:21.140
Like, um....

00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:24.350
O-Oh, yeah! I thought, 
that's some wild new fashion!

00:08:25.560 --> 00:08:27.400
You punk!

00:08:28.820 --> 00:08:30.430
These fangs...

00:08:30.430 --> 00:08:31.940
are real!

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:36.210
You're questioning the one thing 
that makes me look like a wolf man?!

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:39.620
He just called himself a wolf man!

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.330
Wait, that bothered you?

00:08:42.270 --> 00:08:44.100
You just said I said it myself just now!

00:08:44.100 --> 00:08:48.050
So you knew I was a wolf man all along!

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:51.670
N-No, I only noticed now 
that you mentioned it.

00:08:52.020 --> 00:08:53.420
Y-Yeah?

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:55.790
So you're a wolf man?

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:58.800
You and your damn obvious bluffs!

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:01.270
Act dumb all you want,

00:09:01.270 --> 00:09:03.080
but I'm taking Youko home!

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:05.020
This is my promise with the old man!

00:09:05.020 --> 00:09:08.100
D-Don't just assume I'm acting dumb!

00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:10.650
M-Maybe you're the one who's full of crap,

00:09:10.650 --> 00:09:11.900
saying you're a "wolf man"!

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:13.080
Yeah?!

00:09:13.080 --> 00:09:15.760
Well, if the moon were out...

00:09:20.090 --> 00:09:21.620
<i>C-Crap!</i>

00:09:22.470 --> 00:09:27.170
<i>This situation is only gonna
get worse if he transforms!</i>

00:09:30.310 --> 00:09:32.840
Wh-What's this light?

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:35.340
He looked at the moon. Which means...

00:09:41.190 --> 00:09:42.850
I'm finally back.

00:09:47.590 --> 00:09:50.210
Thanks, Kuromine-kun.

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:55.070
<b>Heat the cream to about 39 degrees,                                        and beat until it forms peaks.</b>

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:55.070
<b>Hmm...</b>

00:09:58.290 --> 00:10:00.890
<i>Sh-She's not a wolf "man,"</i>

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:01.780
<i>but a woman?</i>

00:10:02.270 --> 00:10:06.290
<i>Then that guy earlier was 
her </i>after<i> she transformed?</i>

00:10:06.290 --> 00:10:09.000
So, Kuromine-kun...

00:10:09.720 --> 00:10:11.790
Hey, are you listening?

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:14.540
Nice to meet you, Kuromine-kun.

00:10:14.540 --> 00:10:16.810
My name is Shishido Shiho.

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:18.590
I'm a wolf man.

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:20.890
Though I'm a regular woman now.

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:25.500
Your eyes tell me

00:10:25.500 --> 00:10:28.390
you've already noticed.

00:10:28.720 --> 00:10:29.620
Yes.

00:10:29.620 --> 00:10:31.400
Actually, I am...

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:37.030
not wearing a bra right now.

00:10:37.180 --> 00:10:38.570
That's what you meant?!

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:41.360
Youko, could you lend me yours?

00:10:41.360 --> 00:10:44.780
Although yours might be a bit small for me.

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:46.840
Wh-What are you...

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:48.410
Shiho, you idiot!

00:10:56.900 --> 00:10:59.690
<i>I wonder if Shiragami Youko's angry at me</i>

00:10:59.690 --> 00:11:02.300
<i>for declining her invitation to 
the amusement park so abruptly.</i>

00:11:02.690 --> 00:11:05.340
I did it to try to bring them together,

00:11:05.340 --> 00:11:07.560
but I may have overstepped my bounds.

00:11:08.120 --> 00:11:08.990
Anyway,

00:11:08.990 --> 00:11:11.600
I can make amends with this homemade cake.

00:11:16.660 --> 00:11:17.610
<i>But...</i>

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:21.240
<i>Could I not make amends tomorrow?</i>

00:11:21.780 --> 00:11:22.410
<i>No,</i>

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:24.790
<i>I want to know how things 
turned out between them</i>

00:11:24.790 --> 00:11:25.740
<i>at the amusement park.</i>

00:11:26.510 --> 00:11:27.740
<i>If...</i>

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:30.160
<i>When they rode the so-called thrill ride....</i>

00:11:31.840 --> 00:11:33.830
I'm scared, Kuromine-kun!

00:11:35.600 --> 00:11:38.380
<i>No, no. Life isn't that generous.</i>

00:11:39.160 --> 00:11:42.470
<i>Maybe when they entered the 
so-called haunted house...</i>

00:11:42.970 --> 00:11:44.640
Give me your blood!

00:11:45.650 --> 00:11:47.010
Shiragami!

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:51.870
Aw, you're so cute.

00:11:51.870 --> 00:11:54.440
You're tickling my maternal instincts.

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:55.770
No way!

00:12:00.520 --> 00:12:01.600
I apologize.

00:12:02.640 --> 00:12:04.170
N-No.

00:12:04.170 --> 00:12:06.000
Why do I keep thinking so negatively?

00:12:07.680 --> 00:12:08.990
What am I talking about?

00:12:09.760 --> 00:12:13.070
I'm trying to bring those two together.

00:12:16.680 --> 00:12:17.920
My bad, my bad.

00:12:18.170 --> 00:12:21.920
I keep telling that idiot 
Shirou to keep a bra on.

00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:25.930
There's no telling when I might look 
at the moon and turn back, after all.

00:12:26.320 --> 00:12:29.490
I just had a horrible mental image.

00:12:29.490 --> 00:12:31.930
Seriously, Shiho...

00:12:31.930 --> 00:12:33.280
Hey,

00:12:33.280 --> 00:12:36.060
your room's surprisingly tidy, Youko.

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:37.690
Your room back at home is more...

00:12:37.690 --> 00:12:39.040
Sh-Shiho!

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:40.650
Seriously, shut up.

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:41.790
And...

00:12:41.790 --> 00:12:44.460
Don't you dare open the closets or anything.

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:48.210
Um, so... Kuromine-kun,

00:12:48.210 --> 00:12:50.150
I'll introduce you.

00:12:50.150 --> 00:12:53.330
That wolf man from earlier 
was Shishido Shirou.

00:12:53.870 --> 00:12:57.450
And this one here is my childhood 
friend, Shishido Shiho.

00:12:57.450 --> 00:12:59.080
She's a separate personality from Shirou.

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:00.970
She's a pervert, so be careful.

00:13:00.970 --> 00:13:02.020
A pervert?

00:13:03.340 --> 00:13:04.520
Nice to meet you.

00:13:04.520 --> 00:13:06.340
You're not denying it?

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:08.680
A-Are you really a girl?

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:12.110
I mean, you were totally male until earlier.

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:15.310
Do you want to find out, then?

00:13:16.150 --> 00:13:17.320
Wh-What?

00:13:17.320 --> 00:13:19.240
What do you mean by that?

00:13:19.930 --> 00:13:21.360
Well...

00:13:21.900 --> 00:13:23.800
How about something like this?

00:13:23.800 --> 00:13:25.610
Do what you want to me.

00:13:26.720 --> 00:13:29.000
What the hell are you doing, 
Shiho, you pervert?!

00:13:30.340 --> 00:13:33.870
I'm just talking to Kuromine-kun.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:37.080
That's none of your concern, is it?

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:42.250
Sorry, Kuromine-kun.

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:45.130
Shirou caused you so much trouble.

00:13:45.570 --> 00:13:47.090
Relax.

00:13:47.090 --> 00:13:49.710
Shirou's the one her old man talked to.

00:13:49.710 --> 00:13:51.440
I don't really care.

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:56.470
What is it?

00:13:56.470 --> 00:13:58.400
What's wrong, Youko?

00:13:58.400 --> 00:14:00.360
Sh-Shiragami-san?

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:02.210
Nothing.

00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:03.690
It's my room.

00:14:03.690 --> 00:14:06.570
It doesn't matter to you 
where I sit, does it, Shiho?

00:14:11.910 --> 00:14:14.370
<i>Not those two. Surely not.</i>

00:14:14.690 --> 00:14:19.060
<i>No, but if they were to be alone 
together in a confined space...</i>

00:14:19.760 --> 00:14:20.840
Shiragami.

00:14:21.360 --> 00:14:22.960
Kuromine-kun.

00:14:31.340 --> 00:14:33.890
Not those two! That'd never happen!

00:14:34.760 --> 00:14:36.120
Don't make eye contact.

00:14:36.120 --> 00:14:37.240
O-Okay.

00:14:40.160 --> 00:14:42.550
What am I thinking?

00:14:42.550 --> 00:14:45.650
Be calm, Aizawa Nagisa.

00:14:47.070 --> 00:14:48.360
Kuromine-kun,

00:14:48.610 --> 00:14:50.420
don't mind Youko.

00:14:50.420 --> 00:14:52.990
Talk to me.

00:14:53.520 --> 00:14:56.060
<i>Wh-What's going on here?</i>

00:14:56.060 --> 00:14:58.320
<i>What exactly is happening?</i>

00:14:58.320 --> 00:14:59.300
<i>I don't know,</i>

00:14:59.300 --> 00:15:02.440
<i>but I can't tell if I'm happy 
or if my stomach's killing me...</i>

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:06.220
<i>A-Anyway, new subject.</i>

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:07.410
<i>Time to change the subject!</i>

00:15:07.410 --> 00:15:09.550
<i>I have to stop this weirdness!</i>

00:15:09.960 --> 00:15:12.490
S-So, Shiho-san,

00:15:12.490 --> 00:15:15.470
are you still aware while you're a wolf man?

00:15:16.450 --> 00:15:17.920
I am.

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:21.690
But Shirou isn't aware while I'm me.

00:15:22.810 --> 00:15:24.940
I'm always aware,

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:26.940
but Shirou's only aware when I'm Shirou.

00:15:27.270 --> 00:15:31.880
I guess that's how it works,
since I'm the main personality.

00:15:31.880 --> 00:15:34.570
So you really surprised me

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:38.090
when you made me look at you so forcefully.

00:15:39.070 --> 00:15:41.250
It was kind of thrilling, really.

00:15:42.470 --> 00:15:43.410
Hey,

00:15:43.410 --> 00:15:45.630
can you do it again?

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:49.280
No, I... I didn't mean to...

00:15:49.680 --> 00:15:54.870
<i>Sh-She's even more of a wolf 
than when she's a wolf man!</i>

00:15:58.450 --> 00:15:59.200
What is it?

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:01.010
Is something wrong, Youko?

00:16:01.010 --> 00:16:02.890
Sh-Shiragami-san?

00:16:06.440 --> 00:16:08.080
Y-Youko...

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:09.620
You got me.

00:16:10.670 --> 00:16:11.740
Wow,

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:15.060
so you transform even when it's a 
photo of the moon you're looking at?

00:16:15.060 --> 00:16:16.740
I never knew.

00:16:16.980 --> 00:16:18.160
Again?!

00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:25.380
Wh-What the hell is this?!

00:16:29.520 --> 00:16:33.610
While I was thinking about all that,
I wound up at Shiragami Youko's place.

00:16:34.060 --> 00:16:34.970
Now what?

00:16:35.600 --> 00:16:38.400
No, now that I'm here,

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:40.250
I'll apologize.

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:43.700
What the hell are you doing?!

00:16:43.700 --> 00:16:46.220
No, that doesn't matter!

00:16:46.220 --> 00:16:48.360
I'm taking Youko back, and that's all!

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:51.320
You lying brat! Give it up!

00:16:51.670 --> 00:16:55.280
Don't think I'll look at the 
moon so easily next time!

00:16:56.610 --> 00:16:59.620
D-Damn it!

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:01.470
Her room was...

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:02.790
This one.

00:17:03.810 --> 00:17:04.910
A flare?!

00:17:08.740 --> 00:17:10.230
S-Sorry!

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:13.880
How could I have...

00:17:13.880 --> 00:17:15.770
I got the wrong room!

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:18.540
What?

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:20.310
<b>Shiragami</b>

00:17:18.540 --> 00:17:20.310
I wasn't wrong?

00:17:21.760 --> 00:17:24.890
Oh, Kuromine-kun, you're so bold.

00:17:28.830 --> 00:17:30.380
Wh-What's...

00:17:32.090 --> 00:17:35.200
Just what are you doing, Kuromine Asahi?

00:17:35.460 --> 00:17:36.400
Class Rep!

00:17:36.940 --> 00:17:41.030
I thought you two would be hitting it off 
after your day at the amusement park!

00:17:41.510 --> 00:17:43.660
N-No, this isn't...

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:45.750
I'm disappointed in you!

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:46.660
Aizawa-san!

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:47.830
Class Rep!

00:17:54.290 --> 00:17:56.120
K-Kuromine-kun, you pervert!

00:17:56.120 --> 00:17:56.740
Lecher!

00:17:56.740 --> 00:17:57.760
Horn dog!

00:17:57.760 --> 00:18:00.260
You... You Eromine-kun!

00:18:00.570 --> 00:18:01.640
N-No!

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:02.750
This was an accident!

00:18:02.750 --> 00:18:03.720
An accident!

00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:08.390
I've done it now!

00:18:08.720 --> 00:18:11.020
Wh-What are you doing, Eromine-kun?!

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:17.170
I said that without thinking,

00:18:17.640 --> 00:18:19.660
but now that I think about it calmly,

00:18:19.660 --> 00:18:21.810
it must have been some kind of mistake.

00:18:24.350 --> 00:18:25.530
Nosebleed?

00:18:27.020 --> 00:18:27.870
You!

00:18:35.400 --> 00:18:38.430
F-F-Forgive my intrusion!

00:18:38.890 --> 00:18:40.720
C-Class Rep!

00:18:40.890 --> 00:18:41.760
Shut up!

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:43.780
Wh-What did you do to Shiho?!

00:18:43.780 --> 00:18:47.010
Shiho's body is my body, too!

00:18:47.010 --> 00:18:49.080
No, it was an accident!

00:18:49.080 --> 00:18:52.340
S-So you <i>did</i> do something to my body!

00:18:52.340 --> 00:18:54.620
Please stop calling it "your body"!

00:18:54.620 --> 00:18:56.610
It just makes it worse for both of us!

00:18:57.990 --> 00:18:59.820
N-Not again!

00:18:59.820 --> 00:19:01.610
L-Lucky me.

00:19:03.070 --> 00:19:05.030
A man and a man!

00:19:05.380 --> 00:19:10.310
Is that the so-called "BL" that 
I read about in Earth books?!

00:19:12.840 --> 00:19:15.300
A true woman never turns 
down a chance to get some.

00:19:15.480 --> 00:19:18.060
Time to eat!

00:19:18.560 --> 00:19:21.050
Isn't the saying "a true man..."?

00:19:21.360 --> 00:19:23.140
H-Hey, Shiho!

00:19:23.140 --> 00:19:24.640
Stop! Stop that!

00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:27.390
Youko.

00:19:28.830 --> 00:19:30.940
What should I stop? And why?

00:19:32.000 --> 00:19:35.800
W-Well, that's not something you do by force.

00:19:35.800 --> 00:19:37.560
B-Besides,

00:19:37.560 --> 00:19:41.360
Kuromine-kun has that nice girl, 
Aizawa-san, who just left.

00:19:41.360 --> 00:19:42.670
And—

00:19:41.850 --> 00:19:42.670
N-No,

00:19:42.670 --> 00:19:45.240
it's really not like that between 
me and the class rep.

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:46.890
Okay,

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:50.290
sleepy time for you, Kuromine-kun.

00:19:52.150 --> 00:19:54.040
Youko, listen...

00:19:55.110 --> 00:19:56.960
Are you sure that's all it is?

00:19:59.320 --> 00:20:00.310
Well...

00:20:00.790 --> 00:20:01.730
What?

00:20:01.730 --> 00:20:03.640
What do you mean, Shiho?

00:20:03.640 --> 00:20:05.180
I don't get it.

00:20:08.460 --> 00:20:11.230
Oh, I was just a bit worried, that's all.

00:20:11.230 --> 00:20:12.910
You're pretty dense, after all.

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:14.570
What? I'm not dense.

00:20:14.570 --> 00:20:15.860
I'm actually pretty astute.

00:20:16.840 --> 00:20:18.110
You're dense.

00:20:18.110 --> 00:20:19.480
You've always been.

00:20:20.040 --> 00:20:21.900
Both about how other people feel

00:20:21.900 --> 00:20:24.040
and about how <i>you</i> feel.

00:20:25.500 --> 00:20:27.390
I'll be going now.

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:29.270
You're not staying the night?

00:20:29.270 --> 00:20:30.500
You came all this way.

00:20:30.930 --> 00:20:33.170
You wouldn't want me 
transforming back into Shirou

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:36.830
and making a fuss about 
taking you back, would you?

00:20:37.760 --> 00:20:38.900
Shiho.

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:41.210
Besides...

00:20:41.430 --> 00:20:42.920
I got a souvenir.

00:20:42.920 --> 00:20:44.470
See you.

00:20:44.470 --> 00:20:45.930
Hey! Those are my pa—

00:20:46.200 --> 00:20:48.240
Wait up, you pervert wolf man!

00:20:48.240 --> 00:20:50.180
Just when you were being normal for once!

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:52.560
Never come back, stupid!

00:20:57.840 --> 00:20:59.150
Childhood friends?

00:20:59.490 --> 00:21:01.030
Both the man and the woman?

00:21:01.310 --> 00:21:02.750
Y-Yeah.

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:05.380
Unlike Shiragami, one is bold

00:21:05.380 --> 00:21:07.440
and the other is kind of a tough guy.

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:10.070
Oh, so that's what was going on.

00:21:10.710 --> 00:21:11.490
Sorry.

00:21:12.150 --> 00:21:14.650
It seems I was overthinking things.

00:21:19.160 --> 00:21:21.080
Before we begin class,

00:21:21.080 --> 00:21:23.720
I'm going to introduce a new student.

00:21:26.310 --> 00:21:27.390
Come in.

00:21:34.880 --> 00:21:36.240
So, uh,

00:21:36.240 --> 00:21:38.310
it's nice to meet you all.

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:41.280
I just transferred to this school.

00:21:41.280 --> 00:21:43.070
My name's Shishido Shiho.

00:21:43.540 --> 00:21:45.490
I'm a pervert. Hope you like me.

00:23:21.080 --> 00:23:27.300
<b>Shishido Shiho's "Ahh~" Moments</b>

00:23:23.280 --> 00:23:25.330
Shishido Shiho's "Ahh~" Moments!

00:23:25.330 --> 00:23:27.300
Shouldn't that be "A-ha! Moments"?

00:23:27.300 --> 00:23:31.510
<b>Part of the picture is going to change slowly <3</b>

00:23:27.480 --> 00:23:29.350
Part of the picture is 
going to slowly change.

00:23:29.350 --> 00:23:30.880
Tell me when you figure it out.

00:23:30.880 --> 00:23:31.930
Ready, go.

00:23:31.930 --> 00:23:32.860
Eromine-kun!

00:23:32.860 --> 00:23:34.380
I-I'm sorry! I didn't mean to.

00:23:34.380 --> 00:23:36.840
Meanwhile, the picture's already changing.

00:23:36.840 --> 00:23:37.880
Really?

00:23:38.390 --> 00:23:39.920
It's already completely different.

00:23:39.920 --> 00:23:40.670
Where?!

00:23:40.670 --> 00:23:41.760
Where?

00:23:41.760 --> 00:23:45.120
Look, my panties disappeared. I'm pantyless!

00:23:45.120 --> 00:23:47.770
Y-You're pantyless?!

00:23:47.690 --> 00:23:51.050
<b>Next Episode:
"Let's Get Sexy!"</b>

00:23:47.770 --> 00:23:50.230
You <i>are</i> Eromine-kun!
